icants for a full-time assistant professorship position. Full-Time Faculty Position in Business Analytics & Information Systems Sabanci Business School, Sabanci University Sabanci University would like to invite applications for a full-time faculty position in Operations & Information Management (OPIM) group at Sabanci Business School. The starting date is planned for September 2027 or later, for applicants with a Ph.D. degree in Business Analytics, (Big) Data Analytics, Management Information Systems, or closely related disciplines, prior to the start date. Part -Time Teaching Position in Freshman Science Course (Advert Reference Code: FDP-NSPT-2026) The Foundations Development Directorate (FDD) at Sabancı University invites applications for a part-time Instructor position to teach a basic integrated science course for freshman students. Professional Teaching Assistant Part-time Position in Freshman Science Course (FDP-NSTA-2026) The Foundations Development Directorate (FDD) at Sabancı University is seeking a professional teaching assistant for an introductory level science course for freshman students. Academic Applications Human Resources fpositions@sabanciuniv.edu 0 216 483 90 00 Links Apply Accessibility Tool Navigation Adjustment Hide Images Screen and Text Reader Content Settings Cursor Enlarge the cursor and change its color. White Black Font Sizing Increase and decrease the font size. - + Text Magnifier Contrast Image  Description Abc Dyslexia Font Reading Guide Stop Animation Clear Selections Dipnot İhale İlanları KVKK Aydınlatma Metni Gizlilik Bildirimi Orta Mahalle, 34956 Tuzla, İstanbul, Türkiye Telefon: +90 216 483 90 00 Fax: +90 216 483 90 05 © Sabancı Üniversitesi 2023 Play All"
