      "description": "Career & Intership Office | Sabancı Üniversitesi Header Top Menu Career My SU Alumni Site içinde ara Hızlı Bağlantılar Hakkımızda TR EN Site içinde ara Hızlı Bağlantılar Hakkımızda TR EN Ana gezinti menüsü About University About Sabancı University Our Philosophy and Goals Our Policies and Documents Rules and Regulations Gender Equality Action Plan Kalite Güvence ve Strateji Kurulu Kurum Değerlendirme Raporları Sustainability Administrative Units and Boards Board of Trustees University Management Directors International Board of Overseers Distinguished Research Fellows Student Union Our Academic Principles Academic Freedom and Integrity Scientific and Applied Research Misconduct Non Discrimination Statement Sexual Harassment Policy Statement Domestic Violence Prevention and Support Statement Academic Faculties and Programs Starting Out School of Languages Faculty of Engineering and Natural Sciences Faculty of Arts and Social Sciences Sabancı Business School All Programs Academic Calendar Support for Education and Career The Foundations Development Program (TGP) Student with Special Needs Support Unit (SSN) Civic Involvement Projects (CIP) Executive Development Unit (EDU) Career & Intership Office Exchange Programs University Registration, Scholarships and Fees Student Resources Scholarships & Tuition Fees Registration Information F.A.Q Research Research Strategy and Management Research Strategy Research Management Ankara Project Office Research Development and Technology Transfer Office (SUATT) Research Planning and Policy Development Office Research Opportunities Centers and Forums Laboratories Information Center Processes Researchers Industry For Entrepreneurs For Students Research Outputs and Performance Research Highlights Patents & Technologies Research Output & Performance University Rankings Araştırma Videoları Campus Food, Drink and Accommodation Food & Beverage Dormitories Faculty Housing Sports, Culture and Art Sport Activities Culture & Arts Events Sabancı University Performing Arts Center (SGM) Health and Safety Medical Center Security Services Business and Environment Safety Campus and City Natural Life on Campus Campus Plan Life in Istanbul Admission Admission Prospective Undergraduate Students Graduate Programs International Student External Transfer and Vertical Transfer Special Student Communication Communication Bilgi Edinme Başvurusu Communication Center Service Providers Social Media Telephone and Addresses Transport Campus Shuttle Schedule Transportation to Campus by Car İ.E.T.T. Bus Schedule Sabancı University Altunizade Digital Campus Karaköy Minerva Han Communication Center Transportation Services Quick Links Quick Links News From Sabancı University (Newsletter) Graduate Programs Support Vacant Positions ELAE Announcements Duyurular ELAE Sınav Duyuruları YKS Kayıt İşlemleri Lisansüstü Başvuru Dökümanları ve Gereklilikler Kurumlara Arası Yatay Geçiş Başvuruları Quick Links Career My SU Alumni Breadcrumb Home Academic Support for Education and Career Career & Intership Office Career & Intership Office We are prepared to support you in every phase of your development journey from your first day at school to your commencement so that you can maximize your career and professional development potential. Would you like to have a Career Counselor? We offer Career Counseling Services to help you discover your areas of professional interest, aid you in the selection of professions and setting career goals, and support you with job-searching strategies and preperation for job interviews. [For details…] Don't miss job, internship and training opportunities! We let you know about the latest local and international internship and job opportunities, trainings, seminars and programs. [For all announcements…] Take an opportunity to meet employers! Employers visit our campus throughout the year so that you can have a better idea about various sectors, businesses and companies, make informed choices, and make the best of career opportunities. We organize seminars, panel discussions and networking events with alumni and leading business executives to help you establish professional connections and gain the competencies needed for professional life. [Career Events...] Experience professional life before you graduate! We believe that an \"applied education\" is the best way to prepare for professional life, and take internship very seriously. Please click here for everything about Internship. Contact alumni! We arrange contact with alumni working in areas you are interested in so you can receive career advice and ask what you have on your mind. Simply send an email to career@sabanciuniv.edu for more information. Career Development +90 216 483 9354 Internship +90 0216 483 9489 International Internship +90 216 483 9921 Links Career and Internship Website Career Counseling Job and Internship Opportunities Internship Career Events International Internship Accessibility Tool Navigation Adjustment Hide Images Screen and Text Reader Content Settings Cursor Enlarge the cursor and change its color. White Black Font Sizing Increase and decrease the font size. - + Text Magnifier Contrast Image  Description Abc Dyslexia Font Reading Guide Stop Animation Clear Selections Dipnot İhale İlanları KVKK Aydınlatma Metni Gizlilik Bildirimi Orta Mahalle, 34956 Tuzla, İstanbul, Türkiye Telefon: +90 216 483 90 00 Fax: +90 216 483 90 05 © Sabancı Üniversitesi 2023 Play All"
