    "https://www.sabanciuniv.edu/en/academic/support-education-and-career/exchange-programs": {
      "title": "Exchange Programs",
      "description": "Exchange Programs | Sabancı Üniversitesi Header Top Menu Career My SU Alumni Site içinde ara Hızlı Bağlantılar Hakkımızda TR EN Site içinde ara Hızlı Bağlantılar Hakkımızda TR EN Ana gezinti menüsü About University About Sabancı University Our Philosophy and Goals Our Policies and Documents Rules and Regulations Gender Equality Action Plan Kalite Güvence ve Strateji Kurulu Kurum Değerlendirme Raporları Sustainability Administrative Units and Boards Board of Trustees University Management Directors International Board of Overseers Distinguished Research Fellows Student Union Our Academic Principles Academic Freedom and Integrity Scientific and Applied Research Misconduct Non Discrimination Statement Sexual Harassment Policy Statement Domestic Violence Prevention and Support Statement Academic Faculties and Programs Starting Out School of Languages Faculty of Engineering and Natural Sciences Faculty of Arts and Social Sciences Sabancı Business School All Programs Academic Calendar Support for Education and Career The Foundations Development Program (TGP) Student with Special Needs Support Unit (SSN) Civic Involvement Projects (CIP) Executive Development Unit (EDU) Career & Intership Office Exchange Programs University Registration, Scholarships and Fees Student Resources Scholarships & Tuition Fees Registration Information F.A.Q Research Research Strategy and Management Research Strategy Research Management Ankara Project Office Research Development and Technology Transfer Office (SUATT) Research Planning and Policy Development Office Research Opportunities Centers and Forums Laboratories Information Center Processes Researchers Industry For Entrepreneurs For Students Research Outputs and Performance Research Highlights Patents & Technologies Research Output & Performance University Rankings Araştırma Videoları Campus Food, Drink and Accommodation Food & Beverage Dormitories Faculty Housing Sports, Culture and Art Sport Activities Culture & Arts Events Sabancı University Performing Arts Center (SGM) Health and Safety Medical Center Security Services Business and Environment Safety Campus and City Natural Life on Campus Campus Plan Life in Istanbul Admission Admission Prospective Undergraduate Students Graduate Programs International Student External Transfer and Vertical Transfer Special Student Communication Communication Bilgi Edinme Başvurusu Communication Center Service Providers Social Media Telephone and Addresses Transport Campus Shuttle Schedule Transportation to Campus by Car İ.E.T.T. Bus Schedule Sabancı University Altunizade Digital Campus Karaköy Minerva Han Communication Center Transportation Services Quick Links Quick Links News From Sabancı University (Newsletter) Graduate Programs Support Vacant Positions ELAE Announcements Duyurular ELAE Sınav Duyuruları YKS Kayıt İşlemleri Lisansüstü Başvuru Dökümanları ve Gereklilikler Kurumlara Arası Yatay Geçiş Başvuruları Quick Links Career My SU Alumni Breadcrumb Home Academic Support for Education and Career Exchange Programs Exchange Programs Exchange Programs New friends, New opportunities, New city, New country! Our exchange programs provide excellent opportunities for SU students to study abroad and students from our partners to study at SU. Students pay no tuition fee if they participate in these programs. The duration of exchange study is one or two semesters. Outgoing Students Incoming Students Educational Activities Sabancı University is among the top three universities in Turkey for sending students abroad. For more information on Sabancı University's partner universities, please visit the International Relations Office's webpage. International Relations Office Job and Internship Opportunities Abroad International Job Opportunities After Graduation Sabancı University students have the opportunity to work with giant brands of the industry and expand their professional business networks in the countries they visit through exchange programs. JP Morgan and KPMG International in England, Komatsu in Japan and Porsche companies in Germany are some of them. Our students are also privileged during their internships. Sabancı University graduates; He/she has the opportunity to pursue a master's degree at leading educational institutions such as Brown, Cambridge, Carnegie Mellon, Cornell, Hamburg, Harvard, Johns Hopkins, London School of Economics, MIT, Michigan, Stanford and Yale. Quality educational institutions in both America and Europe, such as the Max Planck Institute, provide postgraduate education opportunities to our graduates. Learn the Exchange Program One-on-One Highlights of exchange programs, application process, important deadlines Get the dates and answers to any other questions you may have. tel: 0 (216) 483 94 44 tel: 0 (216) 483 93 67 suoutgoing@sabanciuniv.edu Accessibility Tool Navigation Adjustment Hide Images Screen and Text Reader Content Settings Cursor Enlarge the cursor and change its color. White Black Font Sizing Increase and decrease the font size. - + Text Magnifier Contrast Image  Description Abc Dyslexia Font Reading Guide Stop Animation Clear Selections Dipnot İhale İlanları KVKK Aydınlatma Metni Gizlilik Bildirimi Orta Mahalle, 34956 Tuzla, İstanbul, Türkiye Telefon: +90 216 483 90 00 Fax: +90 216 483 90 05 © Sabancı Üniversitesi 2023 Play All"
    },
    "https://www.sabanciuniv.edu/tr/node/1217": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor of Materials Science and Nano Engineering",
      "description": "Assistant Professor of Materials Science and Nano Engineering | Sabancı Üniversitesi Header Top Menu Kariyer My SU Alumni Site içinde ara Hızlı Bağlantılar Hakkımızda TR EN Site içinde ara Hızlı Bağlantılar Hakkımızda TR EN Ana gezinti menüsü Hakkımızda Üniversitemiz Sabancı Üniversitesi Hakkında Felsefemiz ve Hedeflerimiz Politikalarımız ve Belgelerimiz Yönetmelikler Cinsiyet Eşitliği Eylem Planı Kalite Güvence ve Strateji Kurulu Kurum Değerlendirme Raporları Sürdürülebilirlik Yönetim Birimleri ve Kurullar Mütevelli Heyeti Üniversite Yönetimi Direktörler Uluslararası Danışma Kurulu Distinguished Research Fellows Öğrenci Birliği Akademik İlkelerimiz Akademik Özgürlük ve Dürüstlük Bilimsel Araştırmada Dürüstlük Ayrımcılık Karşıtlığı Cinsel Tacize Karşı Önlem ve İlkeler Belgesi Aile İçi Şiddeti Önleme ve Destek İlkeleri Akademik Fakülteler ve Programlar Üniversiteye Başlangıç Diller Okulu Mühendislik ve Doğa Bilimleri Fakültesi Sanat ve Sosyal Bilimler Fakültesi Yönetim Bilimleri Fakültesi Tüm Programlar Akademik Takvim Eğitim ve Kariyere Destek Temel Geliştirme Programı (TGP) Özel Gereksinimli Öğrenci Destek Birimi (ÖGÖDB) Toplumsal Duyarlılık Projeleri (TDP) Yönetici Geliştirme Birimi (EDU) Kariyer ve Staj Değişim Programları Üniversiteye Kayıt, Burslar ve Ücretler Öğrenci Kaynakları Burslar ve Ücretler Kayıt işlemleri Sıkça Sorulan Sorular Araştırma Araştırma Stratejisi ve Yönetimi Araştırma Stratejisi Araştırma Yönetimi Ankara Proje Ofisi Araştırma Geliştirme ve Teknoloji Transfer (SUATT) Ofisi Araştırma Süreci Planlama ve Politika Geliştirme Ofisi Araştırma Olanakları Merkezler ve Forumlar Laboratuvarlar Bilgi Merkezi Süreçler Araştırmacılar İçin Sanayiciler İçin Girişimciler İçin Öğrenciler İçin Araştırma Çıktıları ve Performans Araştırma Bülteni Patentler & Teknolojiler Araştırma Performansı Sıralamalarda Üniversitemiz Araştırma Videoları Kampüs Yeme, İçme ve Konaklama Yiyecek-İçecek Yurtlar Lojman Spor, Kültür ve Sanat Spor Etkinlikleri Kültür - Sanat Etkinlikleri Sabancı Üniversitesi Gösteri Merkezi Sağlık ve Güvenlik Sağlık Merkezi Güvenlik Hizmetleri İş ve Çevre Güvenliği Kampüs ve Şehir Yaşayan Bir Kampüs Kampüs Planı İstanbul'da Yaşam Aday Öğrenci Aday Öğrenci Lisans Adayları Lisansüstü Adayları International Student Yatay Geçiş ve Dikey Geçiş Özel Öğrenci İletişim İletişim Bilgi Edinme Başvurusu Haberleşme Merkezi Hizmet Veren Firmalar Sosyal Medya Telefon ve Adresler Ulaşım Kampüs Shuttle Seferleri Kampüse Araçla Ulaşım Kampüs İETT Seferleri Sabancı Üniversitesi Altunizade Dijital Kampüs Karaköy Minerva Han İletişim Merkezi Ulaşım Hizmetleri Hızlı Erişim Hızlı Erişim News From Sabancı University (Newsletter) Destek Ol Açık Pozisyonlar Lise Yaz Okulu Duyurular ELAE Sınav Duyuruları YKS Kayıt İşlemleri Lisansüstü Başvuru Dökümanları ve Gereklilikler Kurumlara Arası Yatay Geçiş Başvuruları Hızlı Bağlantılar Kariyer My SU Alumni Sayfa yolu Ana Sayfa Assistant Professor of Materials Science and Nano Engineering (Ref: MSE-HR-02-26) Sabancı University, Istanbul, Turkey September 1st, 2026 Sabancı University, Faculty of Engineering and Natural Sciences invites applicants for a full time assistant professorship position. We seek a highly motivated scholar with good communication skills who is willing to work as part of a team. The fields of interest should preferably complement the research activities by the current group members and be suitable for initiating interdisciplinary research with other programs. The successful candidate must have a strong record and potential for top quality scholarly publication, as well as promise of outstanding teaching at both the undergraduate and graduate levels. Requirements: Ph.D. degree in Materials Science and Engineering or related field. Publication record demonstrating research potential. Involvement in project application, reporting processes. At least three years post-graduation experience Research areas:, Materials Science, Nanoteknoloji, Nanophotonics, Biosensors, Micro and Nanofabrication, and Optoelectronics. Publications: The candidate must demonstrate research excellence with published articles on the above topics, in international journals, indexed by the Web of Science. In particular, a minimum of 3 scientific publications in the Journal Citation Reports top two quartiles or having CWTS SNIP score of 1.0 or higher are required. Established by Sabancı Foundation in 1994, Sabancı University provides a world class education to its students from undergraduate to doctorate levels. It is distinguished by its educational system which was unique in Turkey when Sabancı University started its educational activities in 1999. It offers freedom to all its students to choose their academic program within the first two years after they are enrolled in the university. Sabancı University has been the most entrepreneurial and innovative foundation university in the University Entrepreneurship and Innovation Index produced by the Ministry of Science, Industry and Technology of Turkey since 2012. It also ranks one of the top among the universities from Turkey in the Times Higher Education World University Rankings. As a young university with twenty years of history, Sabancı University aspires to become an international reference point for innovation in education and research. More information about University and the programs is available at http://www.sabanciuniv.edu/tr/ . Sabancı University is committed to the principle of equal opportunity and equal treatment in education and employment. The University respects all individuals without any discrimination of gender, religion, national and ethnic origin, race, color, physical disability, physical appearance, marital or parental status, sexual orientation, age, or political affiliation in the administration of its educational, admission and employment policies, and its scholarship and university-sponsored programs Faculty of Engineering and Natural Sciences at Sabancı University accepts academic resumes through a web-based applicant tracking system. Applicants are asked to complete an online application form at https://crm.sabanciuniv.edu/academiccv/application.php?advertcode=MSE-HR-02-26 Deadline for application submissions is September 15th, 2026. Erişilebilirlik Aracı Dolaşım Ayarları Görselleri Gizle Ekran Okuyucu İçerik Ayarları İmleç İmleci büyütün ve renklerini değiştirin. Beyaz Siyah Font Boyutlandırması Font boyutunu büyütün ya da küçültün. - + Metin Büyüteci Kontrast Görsel Açıklaması Abc Disleksi Fontu Okuma Maskesi Animasyon Durdur Seçimleri Temizle Dipnot İhale İlanları KVKK Aydınlatma Metni Gizlilik Bildirimi Orta Mahalle, 34956 Tuzla, İstanbul, Türkiye Telefon: +90 216 483 90 00 Fax: +90 216 483 90 05 © Sabancı Üniversitesi 2023 Play All"
    },
