tür ve Sanat Spor Etkinlikleri Kültür - Sanat Etkinlikleri Sabancı Üniversitesi Gösteri Merkezi Sağlık ve Güvenlik Sağlık Merkezi Güvenlik Hizmetleri İş ve Çevre Güvenliği Kampüs ve Şehir Yaşayan Bir Kampüs Kampüs Planı İstanbul'da Yaşam Aday Öğrenci Aday Öğrenci Lisans Adayları Lisansüstü Adayları International Student Yatay Geçiş ve Dikey Geçiş Özel Öğrenci İletişim İletişim Bilgi Edinme Başvurusu Haberleşme Merkezi Hizmet Veren Firmalar Sosyal Medya Telefon ve Adresler Ulaşım Kampüs Shuttle Seferleri Kampüse Araçla Ulaşım Kampüs İETT Seferleri Sabancı Üniversitesi Altunizade Dijital Kampüs Karaköy Minerva Han İletişim Merkezi Ulaşım Hizmetleri Hızlı Erişim Hızlı Erişim News From Sabancı University (Newsletter) Destek Ol Açık Pozisyonlar Lise Yaz Okulu Duyurular ELAE Sınav Duyuruları YKS Kayıt İşlemleri Lisansüstü Başvuru Dökümanları ve Gereklilikler Kurumlara Arası Yatay Geçiş Başvuruları Hızlı Bağlantılar Kariyer My SU Alumni Sayfa yolu Ana Sayfa Professional Teaching Assistant Part-time Position in Freshman Science Course (FDP-NSTA-2026) Sabanci University, Istanbul, Turkey The Foundations Development Directorate (FDD) at Sabancı University is seeking a professional teaching assistant for an introductory level science course for freshman students. The course is offered in a student-centered format, where all in-class components take place in an active, collaborative learning environment. The contents of the course emphasize scientific critical thinking and scientific literacy discussed through four modules, in which the students probe four open scientific questions closely related to our daily life, using basic scientific concepts from physics, chemistry and biology. The FDD coordinates our core curriculum. For more information on the course, please visit http://scienceofnature.sabanciuniv.edu . The candidate must hold a Master of Science or Doctor of Philosophy degree in natural sciences, with a strong interest in science education. Priority will be given to candidates with a degree in Physics or closely related interdisciplinary fields.  Proficiency in English (speaking and writing) is required. Candidates are expected to have excellent coordination and organizational skills as well as commitment to teamwork.  The position has started once all hiring requirements have been fullfilled (at the beginning of the 2026-2027 Academic year) with a minimum working duration of four months right after. Applicants are requested to complete an online application form and submit a teaching statement and CV at https://crm.sabanciuniv.edu/academiccv/application.php?advertcode=FDP-NSTA-2026 . For inquiries, you may contact arzu@sabanciuniv.edu. For full consideration, applications must be received by August 31, 2026 . Early applications are encouraged as the evaluation process starts immediately. The position involves (but not limited to) the following responsibilities: Attend and help organization of orientation and training sessions for teaching assistants (TAs) Lead TA meetings (weekly) Facilitate problem-solving sessions (weekly) Help with the exam organization, proctoring, and grading Exam proctoring Exam grading Sabanci University, a privately funded premier academic institution, started instruction in the 1999-2000 academic year in its new state-of-the-art campus located in suburban Istanbul. The University offers 12 undergraduate programs and 23 graduate programs in three faculties (Faculty of Engineering and Natural Sciences, Faculty of Arts and Social Sciences, School of Management). The University aims at establishing a high standard of academic excellence and a research-oriented atmosphere both for its faculty and for its students, while nurturing productive relationships particularly with the industries in the region which constitute the industrial heartland of Turkey. The medium of instruction is English. Sabanci University is committed to the principle of equal opportunity and equal treatment in education and employment. The University respects all individuals without any discrimination of gender, religion, national and ethnic origin, race, color, physical disability, physical appearance, marital or parental status, sexual orientation, age, or political affiliation in the administration of its educational, admission, and employment policies, and its scholarship and university-sponsored programs. Erişilebilirlik Aracı Dolaşım Ayarları Görselleri Gizle Ekran Okuyucu İçerik Ayarları İmleç İmleci büyütün ve renklerini değiştirin. Beyaz Siyah Font Boyutlandırması Font boyutunu büyütün ya da küçültün. - + Metin Büyüteci Kontrast Görsel Açıklaması Abc Disleksi Fontu Okuma Maskesi Animasyon Durdur Seçimleri Temizle Dipnot İhale İlanları KVKK Aydınlatma Metni Gizlilik Bildirimi Orta Mahalle, 34956 Tuzla, İstanbul, Türkiye Telefon: +90 216 483 90 00 Fax: +90 216 483 90 05 © Sabancı Üniversitesi 2023 Play All"
